# Emeritus of Ideation, "ward {2}": whenever it becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter it
# unless that player pays {2}. Bot2's only mana is a Mox Ruby, which pays for the Lightning Bolt, so the ward trigger
# counters it and the Emeritus takes no damage. The positive control is the neighbouring scenario, where the opponent can
# pay and the Bolt resolves. The Emeritus came down on turn 1 off two Mox Sapphires and a Black Lotus.

